WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:03.650
Wealth, fame, power...

3
00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:04.440
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates,

4
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:07.820
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates, obtained everything the world has to offer.

5
00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:07.360
attained this and everything else
the world had to offer.

6
00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:10.820
And his dying words drove
countless souls to the seas.

7
00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:11.660
What he said in his final moments drove countless souls to the seas.

8
00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:13.660
You want my treasure?

9
00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:13.700
You can have it!

10
00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:15.450
Go ahead.

11
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:17.040
I left everything I gathered
together in one place.

12
00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:16.660
Find it!

13
00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.250
Everything is right where I left it!

14
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.250
Now you just have to find it!

15
00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:23.750
These words lured
men to the Grand Line

16
00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:26.380
People set their sights on the Grand Line in pursuit of their dreams.

17
00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:26.920
in pursuit of dreams greater than
they'd ever dared to imagine!

18
00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:29.630
The world has truly entered the Great Pirate Era!

19
00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:29.850
This is the time known as
the Great Pirate Era!

20
00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:35.640
Come aboard and bring along all your hopes and dreams

21
00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:41.440
I know together we'll find everything we're looking for

22
00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:42.690
One Piece!

23
00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:52.700
Compasses? Not for me. Left them all behind

24
00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:58.500
I'm headed out to sea, with my heart serving as guide

25
00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.540
Following the ancient map to the spot marked "X" reveals

26
00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:09.760
Yeah, it's only legendary till someone proves it's real

27
00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:13.710
When the world's got you down,

28
00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:16.850
lean on your crew, they'll turn it around

29
00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:22.190
Their biorhythm will carry you through

30
00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:24.230
We're gonna make the most of it

31
00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:31.400
Come aboard and bring along all your hopes and dreams

32
00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:36.990
I know together we'll find everything we're looking for

33
00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:40.040
Got some change to my name,

34
00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:43.250
and maybe you wanna be my friend?

35
00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:48.130
We are, we are on the cruise!

36
00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:49.760
WE ARE!

37
00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:51.340
[LUFFY groans]

38
00:01:50.010 --> 00:01:53.890
<b>Enter: Nami</b>

39
00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:53.720
[LUFFY]
I'm so hungry.

40
00:01:53.720 --> 00:01:56.100
[ZORO] When the hell are
we gonna reach land anyway?

41
00:01:56.100 --> 00:01:57.100
[LUFFY]
Who knows?

42
00:01:57.100 --> 00:02:00.730
We're just sailin' on the wind and
the waves, goin' where they take us.

43
00:02:00.730 --> 00:02:01.770
[ZORO grunts]

44
00:02:01.770 --> 00:02:04.650
Don't you find it dumb that someone
trying to be King of the Pirates

45
00:02:04.650 --> 00:02:06.980
doesn't have a single
navigational skill?!

46
00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:08.360
Not really...

47
00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:10.360
I just drift around...

48
00:02:10.360 --> 00:02:14.110
What about you? Aren't you some
famous bounty hunter who sailed the seas?

49
00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:17.990
I don't have any recollection
of ever calling myself a bounty hunter.

50
00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:19.240
[ZORO sighs]

51
00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:22.330
I set out onto the open sea
in search of just one man,

52
00:02:22.330 --> 00:02:24.540
but then I couldn't
get back to my village.

53
00:02:25.210 --> 00:02:28.800
By that point, I had no choice but to
go after pirate ships to earn a living.

54
00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:30.800
Oh, I see. So you're just lost.

55
00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:32.840
Hey, don't put it like that!

56
00:02:31.300 --> 00:02:32.840
[LUFFY grunts]

57
00:02:38.930 --> 00:02:40.970
[HENCHMAN A chuckles]
Another big haul today!

58
00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:42.100
That's two in a row!

59
00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:45.140
[HENCHMAN B] All of this should keep
Buggy from getting too mad at us.

60
00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:45.940
[HENCHMAN C]
Hey...

61
00:02:45.940 --> 00:02:48.230
What's with that boat out there?

62
00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:49.020
[HENCHMEN]
Huh?

63
00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:53.820
We should check it out.

64
00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:05.540
[HENCHMEN chuckling]

65
00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:08.670
Oh... It's a lady.

66
00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:09.670
[HENCHMAN A chuckles]

67
00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:11.500
Hey, wake up little girl.

68
00:03:13.510 --> 00:03:14.260
Uh.

69
00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:17.050
Please tell me I'm not
dreaming this time...

70
00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:20.220
Finding help out here
in the middle of nowhere...

71
00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:23.310
If you're real, then please,
could you get me some water?

72
00:03:23.310 --> 00:03:25.440
I'm so thirsty...

73
00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:28.520
I'll give you as much jewelry
and valuables as you like,

74
00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:30.650
if you could just
give me one little drink.

75
00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:32.860
No sweat. We'll help ya.

76
00:03:32.860 --> 00:03:36.280
But not until we see what kinda
treasure you're holding on to.

77
00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:37.610
[HENCHMAN B]
Yeah, don't mind us.

78
00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:38.990
We'll just be a minute.

79
00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:39.490
[HENCHMAN C chuckling]

80
00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:39.780
[GIRL groans]

81
00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:43.200
[HENCHMAN A]
Can't get the damn thing open!

82
00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:44.700
Uh. Hold up, here we go.

83
00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:48.000
[HENCHMEN scream]

84
00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:50.170
[GIRL laughing]

85
00:03:50.170 --> 00:03:52.420
If you want, you can
keep the whole thing!

86
00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:53.630
It's not my style.

87
00:03:53.630 --> 00:03:54.760
[HENCHMEN scream]

88
00:03:53.630 --> 00:03:57.220
[energetic music]

89
00:03:54.760 --> 00:03:56.010
But that's our boat!

90
00:03:56.010 --> 00:03:57.220
You tricked us!

91
00:03:58.930 --> 00:04:02.970
From the look of those clouds moving in
from the south, I'd say a cold front's coming.

92
00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:07.940
So you can probably expect strong winds
and squalls any time now, really.

93
00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:11.980
Also, in that small a boat,
you run a bit of a chance of capsizing.

94
00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:13.610
[HENCHMEN gasp]

95
00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:21.070
[HENCHMEN screaming]

96
00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:22.280
[GIRL]
Bingo!

97
00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:24.240
See ya!

98
00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:27.750
I'll just take whatever
treasure you guys got here!

99
00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:29.750
[HENCHMAN A]
Get back here, you bitch!

100
00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:31.630
[HENCHMAN B gurgling]
We'll get you for this!

101
00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:35.800
[ZORO]
Uh. I am so hungry. It's killing me!

102
00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:37.340
[LUFFY]
Hm?

103
00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:39.760
[ZORO]
Hey, look, a bird.

104
00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:41.390
I know! Let's eat it!

105
00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:43.390
Huh? How do we catch it?

106
00:04:43.390 --> 00:04:44.680
[LUFFY]
Leave that to me!

107
00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:47.600
Gum-Gum...

108
00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:49.060
Rocket!

109
00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:51.730
Makes sense...

110
00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:53.310
[LUFFY yelps]

111
00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:55.020
[ZORO]
Hm?

112
00:04:55.650 --> 00:04:57.990
[LUFFY groaning]

113
00:04:57.990 --> 00:05:00.150
[energetic music]

114
00:04:58.320 --> 00:05:00.150
[LUFFY screaming]

115
00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:01.410
Help me!

116
00:05:01.410 --> 00:05:03.950
You moron! What the
hell's goin' on now?!

117
00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:10.710
[HENCHMAN A gasps]
Hey, you there! Stop!

118
00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:13.460
Please! Men overboard!
Stop! Men overboard!

119
00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:16.750
I can't believe I find
ship-wreckers at a time like this!

120
00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:18.970
I can't stop, you're just
gonna have to jump in!

121
00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:20.680
[HENCHMEN]
What?!

122
00:05:20.680 --> 00:05:23.430
[HENCHMEN screaming]

123
00:05:23.430 --> 00:05:25.300
I'm actually impressed
you made it onboard.

124
00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:26.760
[HENCHMEN]
Are you trying to kill us?!

125
00:05:27.140 --> 00:05:29.270
[HENCHMAN A]
Stop the boat now!

126
00:05:29.270 --> 00:05:33.020
The three of us are members
of Buggy the Clown's pirate crew.

127
00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:34.610
This boat is ours now!

128
00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:36.270
Huh?

129
00:05:37.110 --> 00:05:39.070
[HENCHMAN A laughing]

130
00:05:37.110 --> 00:05:43.030
[HENCHMAN B & C laughing]

131
00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:39.610
I'm sorry...

132
00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:43.030
We had no idea you were
the famous Pirate Hunter Zoro! [chuckles]

133
00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:45.240
[HENCHMEN]
Please forgive us!

134
00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:48.370
[ZORO] Thanks to you three idiots,
I lost sight of my friend.

135
00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:50.120
So just keep paddling.

136
00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:51.210
[HENCHMEN]
Yes, sir!

137
00:05:51.210 --> 00:05:52.580
Knowing Luffy...

138
00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:55.590
he'll probably pull off
something once he spots land.

139
00:05:56.840 --> 00:06:00.590
[HENCHMAN B]
So, any ideas about what we do now?

140
00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:01.800
[HENCHMAN C]
Good question.

141
00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:06.760
If Captain Buggy finds out a girl stole
our boat and our treasure, we're history.

142
00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:07.810
[HENCHMAN A]
I know...

143
00:06:07.810 --> 00:06:10.020
[ZORO]
Huh? So who is this Buggy guy?

144
00:06:10.020 --> 00:06:13.270
[HENCHMAN A] Uh... You've
never heard of Buggy the Clown?!

145
00:06:13.270 --> 00:06:14.600
[ZORO]
Nope.

146
00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:17.610
He's the ruthless captain
of our pirate ship.

147
00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:19.480
And he's eaten one of the devil fruits!

148
00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:24.360
But above everything else,
he is a one truly terrifying man.

149
00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:41.920
[GIRL panting]

150
00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:44.380
[GIRL]
Yes, I've finally got it!

151
00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:46.060
Hey girl, get back here!

152
00:06:46.060 --> 00:06:48.640
You better give us
that map back or else!

153
00:06:48.640 --> 00:06:50.640
[HENCHMAN X] We just stole
that chart of the Grand Line!

154
00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:52.680
It belongs to us!

155
00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:53.980
Dammit!

156
00:06:53.980 --> 00:06:56.480
If we don't get that thing back,
then we're as good as dead!

157
00:06:56.480 --> 00:06:59.110
We'll be killed by one of
the Captain's cannonballs!

158
00:07:03.820 --> 00:07:05.240
[HENCHMAN X]
Captain Buggy!

159
00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:07.450
I've spotted something high
in the sky above the port.

160
00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:09.620
[BUGGY]
Well, shoot it down!

161
00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:11.540
[cannon fires]

162
00:07:11.540 --> 00:07:12.870
[GIRL panting]

163
00:07:14.040 --> 00:07:16.120
[gasps]

164
00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:17.250
What's that?

165
00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:23.840
[LUFFY screaming]

166
00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:25.300
[GIRL screams]

167
00:07:27.470 --> 00:07:28.930
What... was that?!

168
00:07:28.930 --> 00:07:30.550
What the hell...?

169
00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:32.140
A guy fell from the sky.

170
00:07:32.890 --> 00:07:33.640
[LUFFY]
Dammit...

171
00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:36.730
Why were there
cannonballs flying at me?

172
00:07:36.730 --> 00:07:37.350
[gasps]

173
00:07:41.860 --> 00:07:43.440
[LUFFY]
At least I'm safe now.

174
00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:44.620
And...

175
00:07:44.620 --> 00:07:46.360
what just happened to me
was awesome.

176
00:07:50.410 --> 00:07:51.740
Geez...

177
00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:54.410
[LUFFY]
I'm so hungry.

178
00:07:51.910 --> 00:07:53.290
Oh, hey, boss!

179
00:07:53.290 --> 00:07:55.040
Thanks for coming to save me!

180
00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:55.620
Huh?

181
00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:57.000
[squeals]

182
00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:57.830
Who're you?

183
00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:00.210
[HENCHMEN growling]

184
00:08:00.210 --> 00:08:01.710
[GIRL]
They're all yours now, boss.

185
00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:02.670
Have fun!

186
00:08:05.550 --> 00:08:06.960
[HENCHMAN X]
Hey! That girl's getting away!

187
00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:09.050
[HENCHMAN X] That's okay.
We've got her boss now.

188
00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:10.930
[HENCHMAN X]
You're in trouble, kid.

189
00:08:10.930 --> 00:08:13.430
You shoulda let
your crony fend for herself.

190
00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:15.930
You guys know of anywhere
good to eat around here?

191
00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:17.890
Food's the least of
your worries now!

192
00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:19.060
[gasps]

193
00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:30.030
You better keep your
hands off my hat!

194
00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:31.780
[BOTH]
You bastard!

195
00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:33.910
I wonder if they've
killed that poor guy yet.

196
00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:34.870
[BOTH yelling]

197
00:08:34.870 --> 00:08:38.330
[LUFFY]
Gum-Gum Pistol!

198
00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:39.670
[BOTH yell, groan]

199
00:08:43.670 --> 00:08:45.380
[GIRL]
Wow.

200
00:08:45.380 --> 00:08:47.380
You're really strong!

201
00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:48.590
Huh?

202
00:08:50.260 --> 00:08:53.350
Even though both of them had sabers,
you beat them barehanded.

203
00:08:53.350 --> 00:08:55.140
[LUFFY]
Hey! You're the girl who set me up.

204
00:08:55.140 --> 00:08:56.270
Who are you?

205
00:08:56.310 --> 00:09:00.480
<b>Nami, a Pirate Thief</b>

206
00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:59.390
I'm a talented thief
who steals strictly from pirates.

207
00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:00.520
The name's Nami.

208
00:09:00.520 --> 00:09:02.440
Hey... Wanna team up with me?

209
00:09:02.900 --> 00:09:05.900
Um, thanks anyway, lady,
but I think I'll pass.

210
00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:06.780
[NAMI stammers]

211
00:09:06.780 --> 00:09:08.190
Hold on...!

212
00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:09.650
[NAMI grunts]

213
00:09:09.650 --> 00:09:11.360
[NAMI]
At least think about it first.

214
00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:16.620
[BUGGY] You're telling me
they still haven't caught the thief?

215
00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:17.540
[HENCHMAN X]
Uh...

216
00:09:17.540 --> 00:09:18.540
Not yet...

217
00:09:18.540 --> 00:09:19.660
But...

218
00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:21.120
But they should be in pursuit...

219
00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:23.170
right now, Captain... Sir.

220
00:09:23.210 --> 00:09:28.960
<b>Buggy "the Clown"
Pirate Captain</b>

221
00:09:24.170 --> 00:09:28.960
Now explain to me, how in the world did she
manage to get her hands on that chart, huh?!

222
00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:30.130
[whimpering]

223
00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:33.970
If we're preparing to enter
the Grand Line, and go on a rampage,

224
00:09:33.970 --> 00:09:36.010
then why wasn't the chart
properly guarded?!

225
00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:37.390
I-I don't know, sir...

226
00:09:37.390 --> 00:09:40.230
The map was just sitting out,
plain as the nose on your face.

227
00:09:40.230 --> 00:09:42.020
[BUGGY snorts]
What did you say?!

228
00:09:42.020 --> 00:09:44.650
I-I mean it was easy for
her to find and take it!

229
00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:47.860
[BUGGY] Did you say
something about my nose?!

230
00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:48.110
[HENCHMAN X whimpers]

231
00:09:47.860 --> 00:09:49.110
So!

232
00:09:49.110 --> 00:09:51.860
Are you trying to tell me
you find my nose funny?

233
00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:54.030
Is my nose amusing?

234
00:09:54.030 --> 00:09:55.830
No, sir, you've misunderstood!

235
00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:58.290
Oh, no, you were quite clear!

236
00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:00.280
[HENCHMAN X whimpering]

237
00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:02.120
[HENCHMAN X]
Help me...

238
00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:05.580
[HENCHMEN gasping]

239
00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:09.550
This isn't good...

240
00:10:09.550 --> 00:10:11.880
He's... gonna use the devil fruit power!

241
00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:13.580
[BUGGY growls] [whimpering]

242
00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:16.890
[choking]

243
00:10:18.140 --> 00:10:19.810
Tell me, who am I?!

244
00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:21.560
[HENCHMAN X choking]

245
00:10:21.560 --> 00:10:23.100
Captain...

246
00:10:24.440 --> 00:10:25.770
Buggy...

247
00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:27.150
[HENCHMAN X choking]

248
00:10:28.360 --> 00:10:30.730
And what happens
if someone defies me?

249
00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:37.660
Flashy... death... awaits... them...

250
00:10:37.660 --> 00:10:41.540
Please... forgive me!

251
00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:43.370
[HENCHMAN X gasping]

252
00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:45.120
[BUGGY]
Quit your groveling.

253
00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:48.170
I'll overlook your slip-up
and forgive you this time.

254
00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:50.750
But you better get that chart back.

255
00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:53.510
Don't screw up again... Or else.

256
00:10:53.510 --> 00:10:55.680
[HENCHMEN]
Yes, Captain Buggy!

257
00:11:01.310 --> 00:11:02.270
Yum.

258
00:11:02.270 --> 00:11:04.770
So, do you live in this
big house all by yourself?

259
00:11:04.770 --> 00:11:07.860
This isn't my house, I'm just
staying here for the time being.

260
00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:11.190
Everyone's left this town
because of Captain Buggy.

261
00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:12.860
[LUFFY]
So you're just a petty thief.

262
00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:14.070
[NAMI]
How rude!

263
00:11:14.070 --> 00:11:17.320
I only steal from people
who deserve it: pirates.

264
00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:20.530
So don't compare me
to some scumbag, petty thief.

265
00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:23.040
A thief's a thief,
as far as I'm concerned.

266
00:11:24.250 --> 00:11:29.040
My goal is to earn a hundred million berries,
no matter how hard it is, or how long it takes.

267
00:11:29.380 --> 00:11:30.250
[LUFFY]
Hm.

268
00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:32.630
What do you need
so many berries for anyway?

269
00:11:32.630 --> 00:11:34.220
[NAMI]
It's a secret.

270
00:11:34.220 --> 00:11:36.220
But with this chart of the Grand Line...

271
00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:39.720
the hundred million is
now a definite possibility.

272
00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:41.350
A chart.

273
00:11:41.350 --> 00:11:42.890
So you must be a navigator.

274
00:11:43.560 --> 00:11:46.520
I'm the most skilled navigator
you're ever likely to meet.

275
00:11:47.270 --> 00:11:49.100
Oh, wow. That's perfect!

276
00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:52.440
Then how about you join my crew?
I've been looking to recruit a navigator.

277
00:11:52.440 --> 00:11:53.440
Really?

278
00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:53.940
Sure!

279
00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:55.900
You can be our newest crew member!

280
00:11:56.570 --> 00:11:57.400
No!

281
00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:01.530
I suppose this means you're a pirate.

282
00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:02.120
Yeah.

283
00:12:02.120 --> 00:12:03.700
I made a solemn promise.

284
00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:06.410
I promised the guy who gave me
this hat that I'd form a crew,

285
00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:08.210
and become the greatest pirate ever.

286
00:12:08.960 --> 00:12:12.000
There's nothing in this world
that I despise more than pirates!

287
00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:13.960
I only like money and tangerines!

288
00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:15.130
[LUFFY]
Come on.

289
00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:16.130
Be our navigator.

290
00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:17.420
I said no!

291
00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:19.510
Your loss.

292
00:12:21.050 --> 00:12:22.720
[HENCHMAN X]
Did you find her or what?!

293
00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:24.520
[HENCHMAN X]
No! I can't find her anywhere!

294
00:12:24.520 --> 00:12:25.980
[HENCHMAN X]
Where could she be hiding?

295
00:12:25.980 --> 00:12:29.810
[HENCHMAN X] I don't know, but we're gonna be
in big trouble if we don't get that chart back.

296
00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:32.900
[NAMI]
I gotta do something about them.

297
00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:34.230
[chuckles]

298
00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:38.700
I guess I might consider joining you,
but only if you'll agree to certain conditions.

299
00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:40.530
[LUFFY]
Really? I'll do anything!

300
00:12:40.530 --> 00:12:44.290
Well then, I want you to come with me
to pay a little visit to Buggy the Pirate.

301
00:12:44.290 --> 00:12:45.200
But first...

302
00:12:49.290 --> 00:12:50.500
Why did you have to tie me up?

303
00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:52.790
The rope's just for appearances.

304
00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:54.300
[LUFFY chuckles]
Well, okay then...

305
00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:57.670
I've been looking forward to meeting
some other pirates, so let's get going.

306
00:12:57.670 --> 00:13:00.130
Just hold your horses!
What's the big rush?

307
00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:02.930
[BUGGY]
What?!

308
00:13:02.930 --> 00:13:04.970
Are you telling me
the thief got away?!

309
00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:06.600
[HENCHMEN whimpering]

310
00:13:06.600 --> 00:13:08.730
[ALL]
Please forgive us, Captain Buggy!

311
00:13:08.730 --> 00:13:11.980
I've never seen a more
pathetic group than you three!

312
00:13:11.980 --> 00:13:13.180
Time to die!

313
00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:14.260
[ALL scream]

314
00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:16.480
Captain Buggy, I have news!

315
00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:17.860
[BUGGY]
Ugh. What is it?!

316
00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:20.610
The girl who stole our chart is back,
and with a prisoner.

317
00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:21.570
[BUGGY]
What?!

318
00:13:23.910 --> 00:13:24.660
[HENCHMAN X]
It's her!

319
00:13:24.660 --> 00:13:27.870
That's the sneaky thief
who stole the chart!

320
00:13:27.870 --> 00:13:29.330
[LUFFY yelps]

321
00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:35.380
[NAMI] I've captured the thief,
Captain Buggy the Clown.

322
00:13:35.380 --> 00:13:37.340
And here's your chart back!

323
00:13:37.340 --> 00:13:39.510
Not that I don't appreciate it.

324
00:13:39.510 --> 00:13:42.300
But... why the sudden
change of heart, little girl?

325
00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:48.810
I had another fight with my boss,
and I just can't take it anymore!

326
00:13:48.810 --> 00:13:51.140
So I thought I'd see
if I could join your crew!

327
00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:52.600
[BUGGY snorts, growls]

328
00:13:59.070 --> 00:14:00.440
You're fed up, huh?

329
00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:02.450
I must admit, you're an amusing girl.

330
00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:04.870
I like you! Of course
you can join my crew!

331
00:14:04.870 --> 00:14:09.870
[BUGGY laughing]

332
00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:11.910
[NAMI]
I've successfully infiltrated them!

333
00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:14.120
Pirates are so dumb
and easy to manipulate!

334
00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:17.960
Hey, guys, why am I in a cage?

335
00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:20.460
[ALL laughing]

336
00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:22.550
It's a great day to be a pirate.

337
00:14:22.550 --> 00:14:24.800
Girl, what do you call yourself?

338
00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:26.180
I'm Nami.

339
00:14:26.180 --> 00:14:27.300
Ha-ha!

340
00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:30.060
Then let's have a welcome party
for our new friend Nami.

341
00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:31.220
Let's celebrate!

342
00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:36.310
[HENCHMEN cheering]

343
00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:45.230
[HENCHMEN chattering]

344
00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:50.240
What's wrong?

345
00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:53.120
We're throwing this party
in your honor, so eat up.

346
00:14:54.210 --> 00:14:56.040
Thanks for the party, Captain Buggy.

347
00:14:57.170 --> 00:15:01.090
[NAMI] I'll just keep my eyes peeled
for a chance to take back that chart.

348
00:15:01.090 --> 00:15:04.720
Maybe I'll swipe all of Buggy's
treasure, too, while I'm at it.

349
00:15:07.680 --> 00:15:08.640
Dammit!

350
00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:20.070
This is such a flashy party.

351
00:15:20.070 --> 00:15:21.150
Now listen up!

352
00:15:22.570 --> 00:15:25.240
Men, it's time
to prepare the Buggy Ball!

353
00:15:25.240 --> 00:15:28.990
[HENCHMEN cheering]

354
00:15:38.670 --> 00:15:41.210
[HENCHMAN X snickering]

355
00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:44.720
[HENCHMAN X]
All set, Captain.

356
00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:47.970
Wh-What are you
doing with that thing?

357
00:15:47.970 --> 00:15:50.970
Just observe... the awesome
might of the Buggy Ball.

358
00:15:50.970 --> 00:15:51.720
Light it.

359
00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:15.290
That was one heck of an explosion.

360
00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:18.710
It looked like it was one of
the Captain's beloved Buggy Balls.

361
00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:20.750
Buggy Balls?

362
00:16:33.100 --> 00:16:34.140
That was flashy.

363
00:16:34.140 --> 00:16:36.770
With these Buggy Balls
and my devil fruit powers,

364
00:16:36.770 --> 00:16:39.850
I should have no problem
conquering the Grand Line.

365
00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:41.060
Right, Nami?

366
00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:42.980
Right! Yes, of course!

367
00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:43.980
[LUFFY]
Huh?

368
00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:45.280
– [NAMI gasps]
– [BUGGY] Huh?

369
00:16:45.280 --> 00:16:48.240
But it's my destiny to
conquer the Grand Line.

370
00:16:48.240 --> 00:16:50.160
[growls]

371
00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:52.570
And then I'm gonna become
King of the Pirates!

372
00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:54.540
Shut up, idiot!

373
00:16:54.540 --> 00:16:57.250
[laughing]

374
00:16:57.250 --> 00:16:59.870
[BUGGY] I can see why
you're sick of him, Nami.

375
00:16:59.870 --> 00:17:01.170
Yeah, I know.

376
00:17:01.170 --> 00:17:04.550
He never takes anything seriously,
thinks that life's a big game.

377
00:17:04.550 --> 00:17:06.760
He acts like a little kid.

378
00:17:06.760 --> 00:17:08.840
– [NAMI laughs]
– [BUGGY] I see...

379
00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:13.300
[BUGGY] Then how about I give you
a Buggy Ball to blow away your old boss?

380
00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:14.300
Huh?

381
00:17:14.640 --> 00:17:19.770
It'll be a great opportunity for you to prove
your loyalty to me, your new captain.

382
00:17:19.770 --> 00:17:20.440
Men!

383
00:17:20.440 --> 00:17:21.560
[gasps]

384
00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:31.200
That's all right, Captain.
We don't have to finish him off quite yet.

385
00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:34.280
Let's get back to the welcoming
party and just have more fun.

386
00:17:35.660 --> 00:17:36.290
[laughs]

387
00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:38.700
This is my idea of having more fun.

388
00:17:41.920 --> 00:17:44.750
[HENCHMEN] – Fire! Fire! Fire!
– Fire! Fire! Fire!

389
00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:48.630
Fire! Fire! Fire! Fire!

390
00:17:47.050 --> 00:17:49.840
[NAMI]
If I don't shoot, I'll be killed.

391
00:17:48.630 --> 00:17:56.310
Fire! Fire! Fire! Fire! Fire! Fire!

392
00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:54.680
But if I do shoot, then
I'm no better than these pirates...

393
00:17:56.810 --> 00:17:57.560
Now!

394
00:17:57.560 --> 00:17:58.970
Light the fuse, Nami!

395
00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:03.190
[HENCHMEN]
Fire! Fire! Fire!

396
00:18:03.190 --> 00:18:07.020
Fire! Fire! Fire!

397
00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:10.990
Fire! Fire! Fire! Fire!

398
00:18:10.990 --> 00:18:11.860
– [BUGGY] Hey!
– [NAMI gasps]

399
00:18:11.860 --> 00:18:13.950
You're not wimping out on me, are you?

400
00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:17.950
[LUFFY]
What's the matter?

401
00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:19.580
Your hands are shaking.

402
00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:21.200
[gasps]

403
00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:25.540
[LUFFY] That's what happens when you
take on pirates with half-assed resolve.

404
00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:27.790
[NAMI]
Resolve? To do what?

405
00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:30.010
To kill someone like it's nothing?

406
00:18:30.010 --> 00:18:31.380
Is that a pirate's resolve?

407
00:18:31.380 --> 00:18:32.720
[LUFFY]
No!

408
00:18:32.720 --> 00:18:35.590
[HENCHMEN]
Fire! Fire! Fire!

409
00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:37.970
You gotta be willing
to risk your own life.

410
00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:40.810
[HENCHMEN]
Fire! Fire! Fire!

411
00:18:40.810 --> 00:18:43.640
Fire! Fire! Fire!

412
00:18:43.020 --> 00:18:44.190
[NAMI gasps]

413
00:18:44.190 --> 00:18:45.190
Here, new chick.

414
00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:47.440
Quit bein' sucha tease.

415
00:18:47.440 --> 00:18:49.650
Let me show you how
to light the cannon.

416
00:18:59.660 --> 00:19:01.370
My mistake... Sorry.

417
00:19:01.370 --> 00:19:02.620
[BUGGY growls]

418
00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:03.580
Nami!

419
00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:06.120
What's the meaning of this outrage?!

420
00:19:06.120 --> 00:19:07.130
[NAMI]
I'm sorry.

421
00:19:07.130 --> 00:19:09.880
What's wrong?! Just shoot him already!

422
00:19:09.880 --> 00:19:10.880
[LUFFY]
Huh...

423
00:19:10.880 --> 00:19:13.510
So... now you've decided to save me?

424
00:19:13.510 --> 00:19:14.880
Don't be so stupid!

425
00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:17.340
I'm not doing this for you, you idiot.

426
00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:21.010
I just don't want to lower myself
to the level of these inhuman pirates!

427
00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:23.100
Okay. Thanks anyway.

428
00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:25.440
Pirates took the life of
a person very dear to me.

429
00:19:25.440 --> 00:19:27.310
I'll never be one of them.

430
00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:29.440
Oh, I see.

431
00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:32.030
[LUFFY yelps]

432
00:19:32.030 --> 00:19:33.190
Nami! The fuse!

433
00:19:33.190 --> 00:19:34.150
[gasps]

434
00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:37.610
So you think pirates are just
inhuman filth, is that right?

435
00:19:37.610 --> 00:19:38.950
Get her, men!

436
00:19:38.950 --> 00:19:40.950
[HENCHMEN yelling]

437
00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:41.450
[gasps]

438
00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:43.250
[HENCHMEN yelling, laughing]

439
00:19:43.250 --> 00:19:44.040
[NAMI grunts]

440
00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:51.840
Water, water, water, water, water!

441
00:19:55.510 --> 00:19:57.720
Ohh. Not good.

442
00:19:57.720 --> 00:19:59.800
[NAMI grunts]

443
00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:04.600
[screaming]

444
00:20:04.600 --> 00:20:05.270
Whoa!

445
00:20:05.270 --> 00:20:10.110
[NAMI groaning]

446
00:20:11.270 --> 00:20:12.230
Watch out!

447
00:20:20.620 --> 00:20:22.080
[ZORO]
Hey now.

448
00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:26.580
It's not very nice of you guys
to gang up on the poor girl.

449
00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:28.080
[laughs]

450
00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:28.790
Zoro!

451
00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:29.920
[NAMI]
Huh?

452
00:20:34.840 --> 00:20:36.670
[ZORO]
You hurt?

453
00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:39.590
[ZORO]
I said, are you hurt?

454
00:20:39.590 --> 00:20:42.220
[NAMI]
Uh, no, I'm fine, I think.

455
00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:44.390
[LUFFY]
Whew, what a relief!

456
00:20:44.390 --> 00:20:46.020
I'm glad you found us.

457
00:20:46.020 --> 00:20:48.020
Now hurry up and come
get me out of here.

458
00:20:48.020 --> 00:20:50.350
[ZORO] How do you keep getting
yourself into these situations?

459
00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:53.900
First a bird flies off with you,
and now I find you trapped in a cage.

460
00:20:53.900 --> 00:20:56.650
[LUFFY]
It's an interesting story, actually.

461
00:20:56.650 --> 00:20:57.900
That's...

462
00:20:57.900 --> 00:21:00.990
Yeah... That little brat
just called him Zoro.

463
00:21:00.990 --> 00:21:06.080
[NAMI] The crew he mentioned
earlier... was the Pirate Hunter Zoro?

464
00:21:06.080 --> 00:21:09.080
What's going on here?

465
00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:10.290
[BUGGY]
So you're Zoro?

466
00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:11.460
[NAMI gasps]

467
00:21:11.460 --> 00:21:15.840
[BUGGY] If you're here for my head,
you've got quite a struggle before you.

468
00:21:15.840 --> 00:21:17.840
No. Not interested.

469
00:21:17.840 --> 00:21:19.550
I gave up pirate hunting.

470
00:21:19.550 --> 00:21:21.720
I'm here for my friend.

471
00:21:21.720 --> 00:21:23.470
But I'm interested, though.

472
00:21:23.470 --> 00:21:26.810
Killing you would
bolster my reputation.

473
00:21:26.810 --> 00:21:29.020
If you try... you'll die.

474
00:21:29.020 --> 00:21:31.730
Oh. Is that so?

475
00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:33.650
[sighs]

476
00:21:33.650 --> 00:21:36.230
I tried to warn you, but oh well...

477
00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:39.110
– [HENCHMEN cheering]
– [HENCHMAN X] Get 'em, Captain!

478
00:21:39.110 --> 00:21:40.530
[HENCHMAN X]
You can do it, Buggy!

479
00:21:40.530 --> 00:21:41.740
[HENCHMEN cheering]

480
00:21:41.740 --> 00:21:45.030
[HENCHMEN]
Buggy! Buggy! Buggy!

481
00:21:46.030 --> 00:21:54.380
Buggy! Buggy! Buggy!

482
00:21:55.290 --> 00:21:57.420
Die flashily!

483
00:22:13.560 --> 00:22:15.860
That wasn't much of
a fight, now was it?

484
00:22:15.860 --> 00:22:17.070
Oh, wow!

485
00:22:17.070 --> 00:22:19.280
He's weak! Way to go, Zoro!

486
00:22:19.280 --> 00:22:20.860
No way!

487
00:22:20.860 --> 00:22:23.200
– [HENCHMEN laugh]
– [NAMI gasps]

488
00:22:23.200 --> 00:22:28.990
[HENCHMEN laughing]

489
00:22:31.160 --> 00:22:32.580
Hey, why are they laughing?

490
00:22:32.580 --> 00:22:36.210
Their captain is lying dead on the ground
and yet they're still laughing?

491
00:22:36.210 --> 00:22:37.290
What's going on?

492
00:22:37.290 --> 00:22:38.630
[ZORO]
Fellas.

493
00:22:38.630 --> 00:22:40.880
What do you find so damn funny?

494
00:22:41.380 --> 00:22:43.430
– [thud]
– [ZORO grunts]

495
00:22:43.430 --> 00:22:45.930
[ZORO groans]

496
00:22:45.930 --> 00:22:49.060
[ZORO screams]

497
00:22:49.060 --> 00:22:50.520
Zoro!

498
00:22:50.520 --> 00:22:51.640
[gasps]

499
00:22:51.640 --> 00:22:53.060
Buggy's still alive!

500
00:22:53.060 --> 00:22:54.730
[ZORO]
What the... hell?!

501
00:22:57.860 --> 00:22:59.110
[ZORO gasps]

502
00:22:59.110 --> 00:23:02.110
[BUGGY]
The Chop-Chop Fruit.

503
00:23:02.110 --> 00:23:06.280
That's the name of the devil fruit
that's given me my powers.

504
00:23:06.280 --> 00:23:10.870
I'm a Chop-Chop person, and now
I can never be defeated by the sword!

505
00:23:10.870 --> 00:23:13.710
[laughing]

506
00:23:13.710 --> 00:23:15.920
His limbs... reattach?

507
00:23:15.920 --> 00:23:19.710
And I always thought that the devil fruits
were just a story that pirates told.

508
00:23:19.710 --> 00:23:21.300
So he's a Chop-Chop man?

509
00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:22.960
That's pretty freaky.

510
00:23:22.960 --> 00:23:25.180
<b>Rubber Person</b>

511
00:23:25.930 --> 00:23:29.600
I didn't hit any vital organs,
but that's a serious wound you have there.

512
00:23:29.600 --> 00:23:30.640
So I'm guessing...

513
00:23:30.640 --> 00:23:33.020
– that I am the winner!
– [HENCHMEN] Buggy! Buggy!

514
00:23:33.020 --> 00:23:37.440
– [BUGGY laughs]
– Buggy! Buggy! Buggy!

515
00:23:37.440 --> 00:23:39.360
[NAMI]
Oh, crap!

516
00:23:39.360 --> 00:23:41.070
The tables have turned.

517
00:23:41.070 --> 00:23:44.950
If we don't do something quick,
they're gonna kill all three of us.

518
00:23:44.950 --> 00:23:46.200
[groaning]

519
00:23:46.200 --> 00:23:47.570
I let my guard down.

520
00:23:47.570 --> 00:23:49.160
Stupid mistake.

521
00:23:51.790 --> 00:23:54.620
[BUGGY chuckling]

522
00:23:54.620 --> 00:23:57.670
[HENCHMEN]
Buggy! Buggy! Buggy!

523
00:23:57.670 --> 00:24:02.050
Stabbing him in the back was
a cowardly move, you Big Nose!

524
00:24:05.760 --> 00:24:08.050
[NAMI]
You idiot! Don't call him that!

525
00:24:08.050 --> 00:24:09.340
What're you doing?!

526
00:24:12.350 --> 00:24:15.850
What's that... you... said?!

527
00:24:15.850 --> 00:24:17.810
Who's got a big nose?!

528
00:24:19.190 --> 00:24:19.850
Luffy!

529
00:24:21.690 --> 00:24:22.820
[LUFFY]
Buggy!

530
00:24:22.820 --> 00:24:24.230
[BUGGY snorts]

531
00:24:24.230 --> 00:24:27.280
I'm gonna kick your ass
soon as I get out of this cage!

532
00:24:27.280 --> 00:24:28.860
[laughs]

533
00:24:28.860 --> 00:24:31.530
[BUGGY laughing]

534
00:24:31.530 --> 00:24:33.120
You kick my ass?

535
00:24:33.120 --> 00:24:34.790
You've got a lot of nerve, kid.

536
00:24:34.790 --> 00:24:40.080
No, I'm afraid all three of you
are going to die here today, by my own hand.

537
00:24:40.080 --> 00:24:44.090
So if you're going to do any ass kicking,
you better do it soon.

538
00:24:44.090 --> 00:24:45.920
[BUGGY laughing]

539
00:24:45.920 --> 00:24:47.630
[NAMI gasps]

540
00:24:47.630 --> 00:24:50.590
We're done for. It's all over.

541
00:24:50.590 --> 00:24:53.260
[LUFFY laughing]

542
00:24:53.760 --> 00:24:55.720
[LUFFY]
I refuse to die!

543
00:24:55.720 --> 00:24:57.310
Zoro! Get up!

544
00:24:57.310 --> 00:24:58.310
What?!

545
00:24:58.310 --> 00:25:01.560
You better have a really good
plan or else we're all dead.

546
00:25:01.560 --> 00:25:04.520
So what are you guys gonna do?

547
00:25:04.520 --> 00:25:05.530
[LUFFY chuckles]

548
00:25:08.990 --> 00:25:10.240
I gotcha.

549
00:25:10.240 --> 00:25:12.370
[NAMI]
Nothing makes sense anymore.

550
00:25:12.370 --> 00:25:15.080
This is why I hate pirates.

551
00:25:15.080 --> 00:25:18.870
[BUGGY]
Impudent fool! Time to die!

552
00:25:25.460 --> 00:25:27.760
[BUGGY] Your Three-Sword Style
has no effect on me.

553
00:25:27.760 --> 00:25:33.390
I already told you I'm... Hey!
Listen when I'm talking to you.

554
00:25:47.690 --> 00:25:49.110
– [BUGGY screams]
– [HENCHMEN gasp]

555
00:25:49.110 --> 00:25:52.200
Crap, the cannon's pointed at us! No!

556
00:25:53.410 --> 00:25:55.160
[ZORO]
Hurry! Light it!

557
00:25:55.160 --> 00:25:55.830
[NAMI]
Huh?

558
00:25:55.830 --> 00:25:57.450
– Do it now!
– Right!

559
00:25:57.450 --> 00:25:59.540
Wait! Just wait!

560
00:25:59.540 --> 00:26:01.920
The cannon's still loaded
with a special Buggy Ball.

561
00:26:01.920 --> 00:26:04.040
I don't wanna go out like this!

562
00:26:04.040 --> 00:26:05.750
Done in by my own balls!

563
00:26:05.750 --> 00:26:06.710
[laughing]

564
00:26:06.710 --> 00:26:09.920
[BUGGY] I can't believe you just did
that, you ungrateful little girl!

565
00:26:09.920 --> 00:26:10.760
Wait!

566
00:26:10.760 --> 00:26:12.010
N-N-No!

567
00:26:12.010 --> 00:26:12.720
Stop!

568
00:26:12.720 --> 00:26:14.220
Stop it now!

569
00:26:29.480 --> 00:26:32.570
You okay, Zoro?
How bad are you injured?

570
00:26:32.570 --> 00:26:34.820
Just shut up and don't
worry about how I'm doing.

571
00:26:34.820 --> 00:26:36.990
I need to concentrate if
I'm gonna get us outta this.

572
00:26:36.990 --> 00:26:41.790
[ZORO grunting]

573
00:26:43.210 --> 00:26:45.670
Who is... this guy?

574
00:26:45.670 --> 00:26:47.670
[panting]

575
00:26:47.670 --> 00:26:50.670
Hey, Luffy, who's this?
Who's the girl?

576
00:26:50.670 --> 00:26:53.220
Oh, right. She's our new navigator.

577
00:26:53.220 --> 00:26:54.340
[ZORO grunts]

578
00:26:54.340 --> 00:26:55.840
I'm not so sure about that.

579
00:26:55.840 --> 00:26:57.800
Who are you guys, anyway?

580
00:26:58.470 --> 00:27:00.810
[ZORO]
Move... [grunts]

581
00:27:00.810 --> 00:27:02.600
You're in the way.

582
00:27:03.180 --> 00:27:10.400
[ZORO grunting]

583
00:27:14.450 --> 00:27:18.830
I guess even a lowly pirate...
can still rescue his friend.

584
00:27:27.000 --> 00:27:33.860
As a kid I had a dream of a dazzling treasure

585
00:27:34.060 --> 00:27:40.880
I had a map in my head that I knew would lead me

586
00:27:41.130 --> 00:27:47.980
Charted a course all on my own so nobody would beat me

587
00:27:48.100 --> 00:27:55.240
The promised land was in my hand drew a line in the sand

588
00:27:57.940 --> 00:28:00.620
Look where I am

589
00:28:02.850 --> 00:28:09.030
My one ambitions slipping right through my hands

590
00:28:09.370 --> 00:28:16.300
But if the world ever changes Ill call out your name

591
00:28:16.460 --> 00:28:23.380
We could return to a time when our lives were still the same

592
00:28:23.510 --> 00:28:30.510
Take me to the place where memories remain

593
00:28:30.610 --> 00:28:36.380
Please dont ever let them fade
